## 3. Entity JPA (Java)

```java
@Entity @Table(name = "qa_ticket")
public class QaTicket {
    @Id @GeneratedValue(strategy = GenerationType.IDENTITY)
    private Long id;

    @Column(unique = true, length = 20)
    private String ticketCode;

    @ManyToOne(fetch = FetchType.LAZY) @JoinColumn(name = "staff_id", nullable = false)
    private Staff staff;

    @ManyToOne(fetch = FetchType.LAZY) @JoinColumn(name = "factory_id", nullable = false)
    private Factory factory;

    @ManyToOne(fetch = FetchType.LAZY) @JoinColumn(name = "line_id", nullable = false)
    private Line line;

    @ManyToOne(fetch = FetchType.LAZY) @JoinColumn(name = "group_id")
    private ProductionGroup group;

    @ManyToOne(fetch = FetchType.LAZY) @JoinColumn(name = "po_id")
    private PurchaseOrder purchaseOrder;

    @ManyToOne(fetch = FetchType.LAZY) @JoinColumn(name = "customer_id", nullable = false)
    private Customer customer;

    @ManyToOne(fetch = FetchType.LAZY) @JoinColumn(name = "garment_type_id", nullable = false)
    private GarmentType garmentType;

    @Enumerated(EnumType.STRING)
    private InspectionStage inspectionStage;

    private Integer inspectedQty;

    @Enumerated(EnumType.STRING)
    private TicketStatus status = TicketStatus.DRAFT;

    @CreationTimestamp private LocalDateTime createdAt;
    @UpdateTimestamp private LocalDateTime updatedAt;

    @OneToMany(mappedBy = "qaTicket", cascade = CascadeType.ALL, orphanRemoval = true)
    private List<QaTicketDefect> defects = new ArrayList<>();
}

@Entity @Table(name = "qa_ticket_defect")
public class QaTicketDefect {
    @Id @GeneratedValue(strategy = GenerationType.IDENTITY)
    private Long id;

    @ManyToOne(fetch = FetchType.LAZY) @JoinColumn(name = "qa_ticket_id", nullable = false)
    private QaTicket qaTicket;

    @ManyToOne(fetch = FetchType.LAZY) @JoinColumn(name = "defect_id", nullable = false)
    private Defect defect;

    private String note;

    @OneToMany(mappedBy = "qaTicketDefect", cascade = CascadeType.ALL, orphanRemoval = true)
    private List<QaTicketDefectLocation> locations = new ArrayList<>();
}

@Entity @Table(name = "qa_ticket_defect_location")
public class QaTicketDefectLocation {
    @Id @GeneratedValue(strategy = GenerationType.IDENTITY)
    private Long id;

    @ManyToOne(fetch = FetchType.LAZY) @JoinColumn(name = "qa_ticket_defect_id", nullable = false)
    private QaTicketDefect qaTicketDefect;

    @ManyToOne(fetch = FetchType.LAZY) @JoinColumn(name = "garment_location_id")
    private GarmentLocation garmentLocation;

    private String locationText;
    private Integer quantity = 1;

    @OneToMany(mappedBy = "qaTicketDefectLocation", cascade = CascadeType.ALL, orphanRemoval = true)
    private List<QaTicketDefectImage> images = new ArrayList<>();
}

@Entity @Table(name = "qa_ticket_defect_image")
public class QaTicketDefectImage {
    @Id @GeneratedValue(strategy = GenerationType.IDENTITY)
    private Long id;

    @ManyToOne(fetch = FetchType.LAZY) @JoinColumn(name = "qa_ticket_defect_location_id", nullable = false)
    private QaTicketDefectLocation qaTicketDefectLocation;

    private String imageUrl;

    @CreationTimestamp private LocalDateTime uploadedAt;
}
```

Enum:
```java
public enum InspectionStage { INLINE, ENDLINE, FINAL, INPUT }
public enum TicketStatus { DRAFT, SUBMITTED }
```

Các entity danh mục (`Staff`, `Factory`, `Line`, `ProductionGroup`, `Customer`, `Style`, `GarmentType`, `GarmentLocation`, `Defect`, `PurchaseOrder`) chỉ là entity đơn giản, field khớp bảng ở mục 2, không cần nêu lại.

