GET    /api/qa-tickets              -> danh sách, filter theo factory/line/staff/status/date
DELETE /api/qa-tickets/{id}         -> xóa (chỉ khi status = DRAFT)

GET    /api/master/staff
GET    /api/master/factories
GET    /api/master/lines?factoryId=
GET    /api/master/groups?lineId=
